{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mass.CoordinationWeightDifferences"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.channel_pos_of_b3_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.channel_pos_of_b3_pos","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.lean#L121-L127","doc":"Consequently a positive three-body cumulant forces a strictly positive channel at\ncoordination two — the deficit is an **absence** at `z = 1`, not a suppression of\nsomething the background already supplies. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.b3_le_three_mul_channel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.b3_le_three_mul_channel","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.lean#L111-L119","doc":"**The absent channel must carry at least the whole deficit.** Write the coordination\nweight as a saturating background `u` plus a channel `v` that vanishes at coordination\none. With `u` non-increasing across the one step it is evaluated at, the entire measured\nrise is charged to `v 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.not_both_pos_of_w3_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.not_both_pos_of_w3_le","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.lean#L103-L107","doc":"The contrapositive, and the falsifiable form: a coordination weight whose value at\n`z = 3` does not exceed its value at `z = 2` cannot carry both measured signs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.max_at_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.max_at_three","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.lean#L94-L101","doc":"**The turnover is at `A ≥ 4`.** Both coordinations below `3` carry a strictly\nsmaller weight than `z = 3` does, so the maximum of `w` over `{1,2,3}` sits at `3`,\ni.e. at mass number `A = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.w1_lt_w2_lt_w3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.w1_lt_w2_lt_w3","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.lean#L89-L92","doc":"The coordination weight rises across both steps the measurement reaches. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.w2_lt_w3_of_b3_b4_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.w2_lt_w3_of_b3_b4_pos","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/CumulantTurnoverLowerBound.lean#L75-L87","doc":"**The rise continues to `z = 3`.** `b₃ > 0` makes the first forward difference\npositive; `b₄ > 0` makes the second difference larger still, so the second forward\ndifference is positive too. ","signatureChunk":0}]}